10:23:28.475 | The rumble of burdened caravan wheels carries across the area. A noxious, red-hued fog overwhelms the area with a thick, palpable vapour. An eerie, unholy darkness creeps into the back of the cave, casting deep shadows on all surfaces in the area. Thick, black soot covers the sides of the cavern walls and coats the floor with a thick, tarry slime. Large heaps of broken rock and other debris pile up in the back of the tunnel. Deep scorch marks scar the jagged surface of the rock, which stands as a blockade against further exploration into the caverns. The acrid odour of sulphur and scorched stone float in the air, creating a slight haze that drifts into the darkness. Bloated with blood and flesh, a frenzied bloodworm sets its beady eyes on you. There are 2 swarms of bees here. A spectral owl swoops here on silent wings. Standing still as a statue, a blood steed has fixed its fiery red eyes on some movement in the distance. Like a mountain against the wind, a storm bull is standing here, motionless. Twinned albino orbs gleam upon the hilt of a crimson-hued daegger as it exudes its malevolent presence across the surroundings. There is a small group of patches of lumic moss here. Stretching its wings in an impressive display is an ebony pegasus, its dark coat absorbing the surrounding light. There are 5 corpses of a huge rat here. Blood blossoms from the countless wounds on the dead body of a rajamala slaver. There are 2 corpses of a giant crow here. Twinkling and gleaming, a large pile of golden sovereigns rests here. Hands of rotting flesh and white bone push up from the ground. Sir Antoninus Nithilar is here. He wields Matsuhama's morningstar in each hand. Khovroth Agathon is riding on an ebony pegasus. He wields a Dreadblade bastard sword in both hands. Sir Arador Aristata, Knight of Mhaldor is riding on a blood steed. He wields a Scimitar of Eagles in each hand. The soul of Sprucebruce roams the land, bodiless.
